    "one Maven module, com.squareup:javapoet 1.14.0-SNAPSHOT, with no dependency at compile scope: every declared dependency is test scope",
    "the compiler plugin sets <compilerId>javac-with-errorprone</compilerId> and <forceJavacCompilerUse>true</forceJavacCompilerUse>, with plexus-compiler-javac-errorprone 2.8.2 and error_prone_core 2.3.1 as plugin dependencies: Error Prone 2.3.1 predates Java 17, so the unmodified pom does not compile on a Java 17 JDK (class file has wrong version 61.0, should be 53.0)",
    "the Java level is the property java.version = 1.8, read by <source> and <target> of the compiler plugin; CI builds on Zulu JDK 8",
    "truth, compile-testing and junit take their versions from properties (truth.version, compile-testing.version, junit.version): declared is the property value, declared_in names the property",
    "the parent org.sonatype.oss:oss-parent 7 is inherited configuration fetched from Maven Central, not a dependency; it is where the build's extra repositories come from",
    "maven-checkstyle-plugin runs the checkstyle goal in the verify phase with checkstyle.xml; CI also runs source:jar and javadoc:jar, plugins with no version in the pom",
